Package: com.legacyfixes.youtubekids
Name: LegacyFix: YouTube Kids
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Compatibility helpers for YouTube Kids on iOS 6-9 (32-bit). Suppresses update nags, can spoof the reported iOS version and User-Agent, and ships a config-driven hook engine for app-specific fixes.
Maintainer: LegacyFixes
Author: LegacyFixes
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 10.0)
